      "fact": "Verified744e ordinary no-argument product launched as PID5676/birth134371425735265747 in the exact active Medium Run desktop. Its settings window was actually visible/foreground and Escape destroyed it. Product reported exact_manifest_Run plus enabled exact-guest input resources, not function PASS. An independently pinned new Terminal PID6308/birth134371425757292549/root131932/TID6412 was actually sameMedium/SID/Run member. Foreign desktop handle736/name, source GUI and VDM S_OK/currentTRUE were observed; foreground was not reclaimed. Terminal preparation metadata remains historical PREPARED_NOT_LAUNCHED rather than being rewritten."
